---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="生活 · 林煜轩" section="life">
  <section class="page-heading wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">04 / OBSERVATIONS OUTSIDE THE MODEL</p>
    <h1>
      回到真实的<span>光线与时间。</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="heading-bottom">
      <p>
        带着眼睛出门，带着记忆回来。
        <br />
        一些路过的城市，一些想留住的瞬间。
      </p>
      <span class="mono">PERSONAL OBSERVATIONS / PHOTOGRAPHY</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap life-feature">
    <a class="life-feature-image" href="/life/singapore/">
      <img
        src="/media/singapore-8.webp"
        width="1400"
        height="900"
        alt="夜色中新加坡滨海湾花园的超级树"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <span class="image-badge">进入影集 ↗</span>
    </a>
    <div class="life-feature-caption">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">01 / CITY WALK / JULY 2025</p>
        <h2>
          <a href="/life/singapore/">新加坡，入夜之后。</a>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          从樟宜的雨漩涡，到滨海湾的灯光。
          <br />
          用九张照片，记住一座城市的呼吸。
        </p>
        <a href="/life/singapore/" class="text-link">
          Singapore through my lens ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap life-pair">
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/media/singapore-6.webp"
        alt="新加坡牛车水的店屋长廊"
        width="650"
        height="850"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span class="mono">01 / CHINATOWN</span>
        <span>街巷里的颜色</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/media/singapore-4.webp"
        alt="克利福德码头夜间照明的柱廊"
        width="650"
        height="850"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span class="mono">02 / CLIFFORD PIER</span>
        <span>夜晚的另一种秩序</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap life-quote">
    <span class="eyebrow">NOTE TO SELF</span>
    <p>
      偶尔离开熟悉的路径。
      <br />
      <em>有些答案，在路上。</em>
    </p>
    <a href="/life/singapore/" class="round-link">
      看完整影集 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</Base>
